This product is an auxiliary local facility for the cloud-model stage of legal
work. It makes no claim of complete anonymization and never outputs a
"SAFE" / "100% ANONYMIZED" verdict. Sanitized outputs always carry explicit
status: AUTO_READY, REVIEW_REQUIRED, READY_BY_HUMAN, CLOSED_BLOCK or
ENGINE_ERROR.
